              <span class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-blue-400">wrong trade-off</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-semibold tracking-tight text-lg">Blockchain answers a commerce question with seconds of latency.</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-[color:var(--color-text-muted)] leading-relaxed">
              1–12 second finality + gas fees + an audit story that doesn't pass SOC&nbsp;2 or the EU AI Act. Fine for settlement; unusable for the 90% of agent traffic that's research, scheduling, reading, automation.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="mt-10 max-w-3xl text-[color:var(--color-text-muted)] leading-relaxed">
        <span class="text-[color:var(--color-accent-bright)] font-medium">The classical-PKI answer is missing.</span>
        That's what AgentPKI is — open spec, edge-verified, vendor-neutral, chain-agnostic.
      </p>
